{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history anchor\" data-cite=\"BMC 1.01.010\" data-history=\"/BMC/1.01.010/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.010\" id=\"1.01.010\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/BMC/1.01.010/search\" data-share=\"/BMC/1.01.010/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 55px; min-height: 49px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.010</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Document adopted.\">Document adopted.</span></h6></header>\n<p>Pursuant to the provisions of Sections <span class=\"range\"><a class=\"cite ctx-CAGOV\" href=\"/CA/GOV/50022.1\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">50022.1</a> through <a class=\"cite ctx-CAGOV\" href=\"/CA/GOV/50022.8\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">50022.8</a></span> and <a class=\"cite ctx-CAGOV\" href=\"/CA/GOV/50022.10\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">50022.10</a> of the Government Code, there is hereby adopted the \"Berkeley Municipal Code,\" as published by Book Publishing Company, Seattle, Washington, together with those secondary codes adopted by reference as authorized by the California State Legislature, save and except those portions of the secondary codes as are deleted or modified by the provisions of the Berkeley Municipal Code. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 4970-NS § 1, 1977)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.0", "node_id": "url:https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.010", "record_id": "d187f59bb3218f8d278f1099202b172cd8ea7a55b1c2e09ec780c9fe1d2a3f80", "source_version": "snapshot-2026-10-15:982a1215388573d1320e1b3256519754864e0f022085b6aec0f4427c124d6884", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.010"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc.html", "raw_sha256": "54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc", "source_url": "https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"BMC 1.01.020\" data-history=\"/BMC/1.01.020/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.020\" id=\"1.01.020\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/BMC/1.01.020/search\" data-share=\"/BMC/1.01.020/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 55px; min-height: 60px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.020</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Title--Citation--Reference.\">Title--Citation--Reference.</span></h6></header>\n<p>This code shall be known as the \"Berkeley Municipal Code\" and it shall be sufficient to refer to said code as the Berkeley Municipal Code in any prosecution for the violation of any provision thereof or in any proceeding at law or equity. It shall be sufficient to designate any ordinance adding to, amending, correcting or repealing all or any part or portion thereof as an addition to, amendment to, correction or repeal of the Berkeley Municipal Code. Further reference may be had to the titles, chapters, sections and subsections of the Berkeley Municipal Code and such references shall apply to that numbered title, chapter, section or subsection as it appears in the code. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 4970-NS § 2, 1977)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.0", "node_id": "url:https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.020", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.020", "record_id": "9fd43e80e017a8a13bacaa0a78867d8557c6ce3b57116568aed6e40315cd8e60", "source_version": "snapshot-2026-10-15:982a1215388573d1320e1b3256519754864e0f022085b6aec0f4427c124d6884", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.020"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc.html", "raw_sha256": "54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc", "source_url": "https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"BMC 1.01.030\" data-history=\"/BMC/1.01.030/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.030\" id=\"1.01.030\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/BMC/1.01.030/search\" data-share=\"/BMC/1.01.030/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 55px; min-height: 60px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.030</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Codification authority.\">Codification authority.</span></h6></header>\n<p>This code consists of all the regulatory and penal ordinances and certain of the administrative ordinances of the City of Berkeley, California, codified pursuant to the provisions of Sections <a class=\"cite ctx-CAGOV\" href=\"/CA/GOV/50022.1\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">50022.1</a> through <a class=\"cite ctx-CAGOV\" href=\"/CA/GOV/50022.8\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">50022.8</a> and <a class=\"cite ctx-CAGOV\" href=\"/CA/GOV/50022.10\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">50022.10</a> of the Government Code. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 4970-NS § 3, 1977)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.0", "node_id": "url:https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.030", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.030", "record_id": "f18cb78be6b669c614223fd8f20386be21988dd296453fa0dec9179fe1e215db", "source_version": "snapshot-2026-10-15:982a1215388573d1320e1b3256519754864e0f022085b6aec0f4427c124d6884", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.030"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc.html", "raw_sha256": "54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc", "source_url": "https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010"}]}
