t\" data-controller=\"dynamodal\" href=\"/enactments/Ord4962-NS?product=BMC\" title=\"Ord. 4962-NS\">4962-NS</a>. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 4970-NS § 4, 1977)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.0", "node_id": "url:https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.040", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.040", "record_id": "5d935d4b2f7287126a3a73f7a2b9603712ce818f96f62db2bf27345101092585", "source_version": "snapshot-2026-10-15:982a1215388573d1320e1b3256519754864e0f022085b6aec0f4427c124d6884", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.040"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc.html", "raw_sha256": "54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc", "source_url": "https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"BMC 1.01.050\" data-history=\"/BMC/1.01.050/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.050\" id=\"1.01.050\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/BMC/1.01.050/search\" data-share=\"/BMC/1.01.050/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 55px; min-height: 60px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.050</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Reference applies to all amendments.\">Reference applies to all amendments.</span></h6></header>\n<p>Whenever a reference is made to this code as the Berkeley Municipal Code or to any portion thereof, or to any ordinance of the City, the reference shall apply to all amendments, corrections and additions heretofore, now or hereafter made. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 4970-NS § 5, 1977)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.0", "node_id": "url:https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.050", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.050", "record_id": "f9d1ebd8f4e15aacc846a7febac403dcbad6fba9c18c901e45622a7fbb11d439", "source_version": "snapshot-2026-10-15:982a1215388573d1320e1b3256519754864e0f022085b6aec0f4427c124d6884", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.050"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc.html", "raw_sha256": "54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc", "source_url": "https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"BMC 1.01.060\" data-history=\"/BMC/1.01.060/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.060\" id=\"1.01.060\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/BMC/1.01.060/search\" data-share=\"/BMC/1.01.060/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 55px; min-height: 60px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.060</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Reference to specific ordinances.\">Reference to specific ordinances.</span></h6></header>\n<p>The provisions of this code shall not in any manner affect matters of record which refer to, or are otherwise connected with ordinances which are therein specifically designated by number or otherwise and which are included within the code, but such reference shall be construed to apply to the corresponding provisions contained within this code. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 4970-NS § 7, 1977)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.0", "node_id": "url:https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.060", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.060", "record_id": "80de692ab9a6c9f87063838fc9e844b8259d331cd36bd8a2ffb835569ddbf61d", "source_version": "snapshot-2026-10-15:982a1215388573d1320e1b3256519754864e0f022085b6aec0f4427c124d6884", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.060"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc.html", "raw_sha256": "54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc", "source_url": "https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"BMC 1.01.070\" data-history=\"/BMC/1.01.070/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.070\" id=\"1.01.070\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/BMC/1.01.070/search\" data-share=\"/BMC/1.01.070/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 55px; min-height: 60px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.070</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Title, chapter and section headings.\">Title, chapter and section headings.</span></h6></header>\n<p>Title, chapter and section headings contained in the Berkeley Municipal Code shall not be deemed to govern, limit, modify or in any manner affect the scope, meaning or intent of the provisions of any title, chapter or section of this code. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 4970-NS § 6, 1977)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.0", "node_id": "url:https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.070", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.070", "record_id": "39975747c976343a4878653306c8a87983855e2bbb2c9ed9899eb826b62a795c", "source_version": "snapshot-2026-10-15:982a1215388573d1320e1b3256519754864e0f022085b6aec0f4427c124d6884", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.070"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc.html", "raw_sha256": "54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc", "source_url": "https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"BMC 1.01.080\" data-history=\"/BMC/1.01.080/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.080\" id=\"1.01.080\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/BMC/1.01.080/search\" data-share=\"/BMC/1.01.080/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 55px; min-height: 60px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.080</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Effect of code on past actions and obligations.\">Effect of code on past actions and obligations.</span></h6></header>\n<p>Neither the adoption of this code nor the repeal or amendment hereby of any ordinance or part or portion of any ordinance of the City of Berkeley shall in any manner affect the prosecution for violations of ordinances, which violations were committed prior to the effective date of the code, nor be construed as a waiver of any license, fee or penalty at said effective date due and unpaid under such ordinances, nor be construed as affecting any of the provisions of such ordinances relating to the collection of any such license, fee or penalty, or the penal provisions applicable to any violation thereof, nor to affect the validity of any bond or cash deposit in lieu thereof required to be posted, filed or deposited pursuant to any ordinance, and all rights and obligations thereunder appertaining shall continue in full force and effect. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 4970-NS § 8, 1977)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.0", "node_id": "url:https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.080", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.080", "record_id": "99fcbd15b0174fee1ccfc5fcfe2ac45e6d07b55879fd96b7c4f5c464cbd1bfbb", "source_version": "snapshot-2026-10-15:982a1215388573d1320e1b3256519754864e0f022085b6aec0f4427c124d6884", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.080"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc.html", "raw_sha256": "54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc", "source_url": "https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"BMC 1.01.090\" data-history=\"/BMC/1.01.090/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.090\" id=\"1.01.090\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/BMC/1.01.090/search\" data-share=\"/BMC/1.01.090/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 55px; min-height: 60px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.090</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Effective date.\">Effective date.</span></h6></header>\n<p>This code became effective on March 10, 1977, the date the ordinance adopting this code as the \"Berkeley Municipal Code\" became effective. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 4970-NS § 9, 1977)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.0", "node_id": "url:https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.090", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.090", "record_id": "fcbcec7162a855e2b8b12e73ccfb9c4328c996f36442919b42b0639a42698e0a", "source_version": "snapshot-2026-10-15:982a1215388573d1320e1b3256519754864e0f022085b6aec0f4427c124d6884", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.090"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc.html", "raw_sha256": "54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc", "source_url": "https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"BMC 1.01.100\" data-history=\"/BMC/1.01.100/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.100\" id=\"1.01.100\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/BMC/1.01.100/search\" data-share=\"/BMC/1.01.100/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 55px; min-height: 60px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.100</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Constitutionality.\">Constitutionality.</span></h6></header>\n<p>If any section, subsection, sentence, clause or phrase of this code is for any reason held to be invalid or unconstitutional, such decision shall not affect the validity of the remaining portions of this code. The council hereby declares that it would have passed this code, and each section, subsection, sentence, clause and phrase thereof, irrespective of the fact that any one or more sections, subsections, sentences, clauses or phrases had been declared invalid or unconstitutional, and if for any reason this code should be declared invalid or unconstitutional, then the original ordinance or ordinances shall be in full force and effect. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 4970-NS § 10, 1977)</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.0", "node_id": "url:https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.100", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.100", "record_id": "cc48b28c936462bc10b1ef595c1d07825b313099fb4befbf9ead9e3175971c04", "source_version": "snapshot-2026-10-15:982a1215388573d1320e1b3256519754864e0f022085b6aec0f4427c124d6884", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.100"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc.html", "raw_sha256": "54d4d3e226d7b52899eb492edd1c69a06006eac3cd7a797351fae6e6331647cc", "source_url": "https://berkeley.municipal.codes/BMC/1.01.010"}]}
